{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>西營盤發生火警。今日（19日）晚上8時57分，警方接獲報案，指薄扶林道22至32號恆輝大廈起火冒煙。消防接報到場，發現上均有明火，立即動用一條喉及一隊煙帽隊灌救。火警中，初步有約60人自行疏散。據了解，現場一名年約70歲男傷者，陷入昏迷由救護車送往瑪麗醫院搶救。警方及消防現正調查起火原因。</p><figure><img alt=\"西營盤薄扶林道恆輝大廈起火冒煙，消防到場開喉灌救。（圖片來源：FB/西環變幻時)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188969339076743168650719.jpeg/1HlTot_YfQrvPjM0eUAC0auFYS7KF6Zxk-O665Pjuus\"/><figcaption>西營盤薄扶林道恆輝大廈起火冒煙，消防到場開喉灌救。（圖片來源：FB/西環變幻時)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"西營盤薄扶林道恆輝大廈起火冒煙，消防到場開喉灌救。（threads@taiwang.91cheating4888910)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188968896103714816752109.jpeg/LoOV4xVvCOzVj2fdPdsyjPZ66135xJ4opWtlV6VrZVc\"/><figcaption>西營盤薄扶林道恆輝大廈起火冒煙，消防到場開喉灌救。（threads@taiwang.91cheating4888910)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"西營盤薄扶林道恆輝大廈起火冒煙，消防到場開喉灌救。（threads@taiwang.91cheating4888910)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188968950113767424702153.jpeg/B43X2XKC8uFQak2FsDeW3YaMsWURSV7hMQ5pGTEOaRk\"/><figcaption>西營盤薄扶林道恆輝大廈起火冒煙，消防到場開喉灌救。（threads@taiwang.91cheating4888910)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"西營盤薄扶林道恆輝大廈起火冒煙，消防到場開喉灌救。（threads@taiwang.91cheating4888910)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188968953209294848850349.jpeg/UIkFNJnK8S-L__v9tMGTsVlg8IXZQOJMLp8IXy6fCF8\"/><figcaption>西營盤薄扶林道恆輝大廈起火冒煙，消防到場開喉灌救。（threads@taiwang.91cheating4888910)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T14:01:04.677961+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":369,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T13:47:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T13:58:02.443359+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T13:58:02.443359+00:00","content_hash":"fff163001258befb7be0d324a6dec3cd6a3a6c20aab08cf3e242ed527becc198","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}